  "locationInfoLeaveTitle": "Only to notice you leaving",
  "locationInfoLeaveBody": "With \"While using\", iOS tells Red Panda nothing once it is closed, so the basket could only remind you while the app is open. \"Always\" lets iOS wake Red Panda the moment you leave.",
  "locationInfoBatteryTitle": "No battery drain",
  "locationInfoBatteryBody": "Red Panda does not follow you. It asks iOS once for where you are and draws one circle around it. iOS watches that circle with the cell and Wi-Fi signals it uses anyway, and Red Panda sleeps until you cross the edge. Then the circle is removed.",
